---
description: Bump version.properties when shipping visible site changes
globs: version.properties,site.properties,VERSIONING.md,src/**/*
alwaysApply: false
---

# Website versioning

- Canonical version: `version.properties` (`version=X.Y.Z`).
- Read `VERSIONING.md` before bumping.
- Bump when user-visible work ships or before a GitHub Pages deploy you are preparing.
- Record `→ vX.Y.Z` in `PROJECT_PLAN.md` **Done** rows for that work.
